WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.471
A feast was waiting in the dining room.

2
00:00:07.472 --> 00:00:10.048
The king sniffed.

3
00:00:10.049 --> 00:00:14.509
"Mmm. The food smells wonderful."

4
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.523
Puss clapped his paws.

5
00:00:17.524 --> 00:00:26.610
"Lunch is ready, Your Majesty."

6
00:00:26.611 --> 00:00:30.481
Everyone sat down.

7
00:00:30.482 --> 00:00:34.226
"The food looks delicious," Carabas thought.

8
00:00:34.227 --> 00:00:38.163
"But I must tell everyone the truth."

9
00:00:38.164 --> 00:00:41.663
Puss handed Carabas the bread basket.

10
00:00:41.664 --> 00:00:46.801
"Would you like some bread, Master?"

11
00:00:46.802 --> 00:00:52.706
Carabas gasped. "Puss, your paw is bleeding!"

12
00:00:52.707 --> 00:00:55.166
Puss looked at his paw.

13
00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:58.472
"Oh, it's not a big deal, Master.

14
00:00:58.473 --> 00:01:02.091
I cut myself earlier, but I'm fine."

15
00:01:02.092 --> 00:01:07.092
Carabas jumped to his feet and bowed.

16
00:01:07.093 --> 00:01:10.888
"Excuse us for a moment, please," he said.

17
00:01:10.889 --> 00:01:14.315
Then he picked up Puss.

18
00:01:14.316 --> 00:01:25.732
"You poor thing, come with me."

19
00:01:25.733 --> 00:01:29.612
Carabas carried Puss to a washroom.

20
00:01:29.613 --> 00:01:35.563
"Master, this is silly," Puss said. "I'm fine."

21
00:01:35.564 --> 00:01:41.031
"You're hurt," Carabas said.

22
00:01:41.032 --> 00:01:43.977
Carabas cleaned the wound.

23
00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:47.964
A servant brought some bandages.

24
00:01:47.965 --> 00:01:56.234
Gently Carabas wrapped the bandage around Puss' paw.

25
00:01:56.235 --> 00:01:59.051
"Thank you," Puss said.

26
00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:02.760
"You're a wonderful master."

27
00:02:02.761 --> 00:02:05.673
Carabas patted Puss' head.

28
00:02:05.674 --> 00:02:12.083
"And you're a wonderful cat."

29
00:02:12.084 --> 00:02:16.078
Soon Puss and Carabas returned.

30
00:02:16.079 --> 00:02:20.051
Fiona smiled and turned to her father.

31
00:02:20.052 --> 00:02:24.075
"That's what I was talking about, Father," she whispered.

32
00:02:24.076 --> 00:02:29.266
"A kind, caring man."

